{"seq":3,"slug":"probabilistic-programming-languages","title":"概率编程语言生态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-statistics/computation/probabilistic-programming-languages","wordCount":605,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"概率编程语言生态\">概率编程语言生态</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>概率编程语言（Probabilistic Programming Language, PPL）将统计模型的<strong>表达</strong>（声明式）与<strong>推断</strong>（自动执行）分离，让用户专注于模型设计，计算引擎处理后验推断。</p>\n<p>PPL 设计哲学的三个层次：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Model[&quot;模型层\\n用户声明先验、似然&quot;] --&gt; PPL[&quot;PPL 核心&quot;]&#10;    Inference[&quot;推断层\\nMCMC / VI 自动选择&quot;] --&gt; PPL&#10;    Compute[&quot;计算层\\nAD + GPU + JIT&quot;] --&gt; PPL&#10;    PPL --&gt; Posterior[&quot;后验分布\\n+ 诊断 + 预测&quot;]\">graph TD\n    Model[\"模型层\\n用户声明先验、似然\"] --&gt; PPL[\"PPL 核心\"]\n    Inference[\"推断层\\nMCMC / VI 自动选择\"] --&gt; PPL\n    Compute[\"计算层\\nAD + GPU + JIT\"] --&gt; PPL\n    PPL --&gt; Posterior[\"后验分布\\n+ 诊断 + 预测\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>PPL</th>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>推断引擎</th>\n<th>设计定位</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Stan</strong></td>\n<td>Stan（类 C++）</td>\n<td>NUTS、ADVI、优化</td>\n<td>统计研究者、高精度</td>\n<td>最成熟、文档最全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>PyMC</strong></td>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td>NUTS（Aesara/PyTensor）</td>\n<td>数据科学家、易用性</td>\n<td>Python 生态整合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>NumPyro</strong></td>\n<td>Python（JAX）</td>\n<td>NUTS、SVI</td>\n<td>大规模、GPU</td>\n<td>JAX JIT，极快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Turing.jl</strong></td>\n<td>Julia</td>\n<td>HMC、多种</td>\n<td>研究者、灵活性</td>\n<td>Julia 性能+表达力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Pyro</strong></td>\n<td>Python（PyTorch）</td>\n<td>SVI、MCMC</td>\n<td>深度贝叶斯</td>\n<td>神经网络整合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"stan-统计学研究者的首选\">Stan：统计学研究者的首选</h2><p>Stan 是独立编译型 PPL，通过自动微分实现高效 NUTS 采样。Stan 的核心设计原则：<strong>显式声明数据类型和约束</strong>，编译阶段捕获错误，运行阶段高效。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"stan\" data-code=\"// 层次正态模型：Stan 代码示例&#10;data {&#10;    int&lt;lower=0&gt; N;          // 观测数&#10;    int&lt;lower=0&gt; J;          // 组数&#10;    array[N] int&lt;lower=1, upper=J&gt; group;&#10;    vector[N] y;&#10;}&#10;parameters {&#10;    real mu_global;          // 全局均值&#10;    real&lt;lower=0&gt; sigma_global;  // 组间标准差&#10;    vector[J] theta;         // 各组效应&#10;    real&lt;lower=0&gt; sigma;     // 组内标准差&#10;}&#10;model {&#10;    // 超先验&#10;    mu_global ~ normal(0, 10);&#10;    sigma_global ~ half_normal(0, 5);&#10;    sigma ~ half_normal(0, 5);&#10;&#10;    // 层次先验：各组均值来自全局分布&#10;    theta ~ normal(mu_global, sigma_global);&#10;&#10;    // 似然&#10;    for (n in 1:N) {&#10;        y[n] ~ normal(theta[group[n]], sigma);&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;generated quantities {&#10;    // 后验预测分布&#10;    array[N] real y_rep;&#10;    for (n in 1:N) {&#10;        y_rep[n] = normal_rng(theta[group[n]], sigma);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 层次正态模型：Stan 代码示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    int&#x3C;lower=0> N;          // 观测数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    int&#x3C;lower=0> J;          // 组数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    array[N] int&#x3C;lower=1, upper=J> group;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vector[N] y;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>parameters {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    real mu_global;          // 全局均值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    real&#x3C;lower=0> sigma_global;  // 组间标准差</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vector[J] theta;         // 各组效应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    real&#x3C;lower=0> sigma;     // 组内标准差</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>model {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 超先验</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mu_global ~ normal(0, 10);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sigma_global ~ half_normal(0, 5);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sigma ~ half_normal(0, 5);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 层次先验：各组均值来自全局分布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    theta ~ normal(mu_global, sigma_global);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 似然</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (n in 1:N) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        y[n] ~ normal(theta[group[n]], sigma);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>generated quantities {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 后验预测分布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    array[N] real y_rep;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (n in 1:N) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        y_rep[n] = normal_rng(theta[group[n]], sigma);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import cmdstanpy&#10;&#10;# 编译和运行 Stan 模型&#10;model = cmdstanpy.CmdStanModel(stan_file=&quot;hierarchical.stan&quot;)&#10;data_dict = {&quot;N&quot;: 100, &quot;J&quot;: 5, &quot;group&quot;: group_ids, &quot;y&quot;: y_data}&#10;fit = model.sample(data=data_dict, chains=4, iter_sampling=1000)&#10;print(fit.summary())\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cmdstanpy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 编译和运行 Stan 模型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cmdstanpy.CmdStanModel(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">stan_file</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hierarchical.stan\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data_dict </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"N\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"J\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"group\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: group_ids, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"y\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: y_data}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.sample(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data_dict, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">chains</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">iter_sampling</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fit.summary())</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Stan 的生命周期：<code>.stan</code> 文件 → C++ 编译 → 可执行文件 → 并行链采样 → ArviZ 分析。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pymc-python-生态的首选\">PyMC：Python 生态的首选</h2><p>PyMC 使用 Python 语法声明模型，对 Python 用户最友好，与 pandas/numpy/matplotlib 无缝集成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import pymc as pm&#10;import numpy as np&#10;import arviz as az&#10;&#10;# 贝叶斯 A/B 测试示例&#10;np.random.seed(42)&#10;n_A, k_A = 1000, 450  # A 组：1000次，450次转化&#10;n_B, k_B = 1000, 510  # B 组：1000次，510次转化&#10;&#10;with pm.Model() as ab_model:&#10;    # 先验&#10;    p_A = pm.Beta(&quot;p_A&quot;, alpha=2, beta=2)&#10;    p_B = pm.Beta(&quot;p_B&quot;, alpha=2, beta=2)&#10;&#10;    # 似然&#10;    obs_A = pm.Binomial(&quot;obs_A&quot;, n=n_A, p=p_A, observed=k_A)&#10;    obs_B = pm.Binomial(&quot;obs_B&quot;, n=n_B, p=p_B, observed=k_B)&#10;&#10;    # 派生量：B 优于 A 的概率&#10;    delta = pm.Deterministic(&quot;delta&quot;, p_B - p_A)&#10;&#10;    trace = pm.sample(2000, tune=1000, return_inferencedata=True)&#10;&#10;# P(B &gt; A)&#10;prob_B_better = float((trace.posterior[&quot;delta&quot;] &gt; 0).mean())&#10;print(f&quot;P(B &gt; A) = {prob_B_better:.3f}&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 可视化后验&#10;az.plot_posterior(trace, var_names=[&quot;p_A&quot;, &quot;p_B&quot;, &quot;delta&quot;])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pymc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> arviz </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> az</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 贝叶斯 A/B 测试示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">np.random.seed(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n_A, k_A </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">450</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # A 组：1000次，450次转化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n_B, k_B </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">510</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # B 组：1000次，510次转化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pm.Model() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ab_model:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 先验</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    p_A </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pm.Beta(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p_A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">beta</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    p_B </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pm.Beta(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p_B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">beta</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 似然</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    obs_A </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pm.Binomial(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"obs_A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n_A, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p_A, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">observed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">k_A)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    obs_B </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pm.Binomial(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"obs_B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n_B, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p_B, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">observed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">k_B)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 派生量：B 优于 A 的概率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    delta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pm.Deterministic(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"delta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, p_B </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_A)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    trace </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pm.sample(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tune</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">return_inferencedata</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># P(B > A)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prob_B_better </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((trace.posterior[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"delta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).mean())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"P(B > A) = </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prob_B_better</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.3f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 可视化后验</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">az.plot_posterior(trace, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">var_names</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p_A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p_B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"delta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span></code></pre></div><p>PyMC 的重参数化技巧（以层次模型为例）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"with pm.Model() as hierarchical_model:&#10;    # 非中心化参数化：避免漏斗形后验导致的采样困难&#10;    mu_global = pm.Normal(&quot;mu_global&quot;, 0, 10)&#10;    sigma_global = pm.HalfNormal(&quot;sigma_global&quot;, 5)&#10;&#10;    # 非中心化：theta = mu + sigma * z&#10;    z = pm.Normal(&quot;z&quot;, 0, 1, shape=J)&#10;    theta = pm.Deterministic(&quot;theta&quot;, mu_global + sigma_global * z)&#10;&#10;    # 比中心化参数化混合更好（特别是 sigma_global 小时）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pm.Model() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hierarchical_model:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 非中心化参数化：避免漏斗形后验导致的采样困难</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mu_global </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pm.Normal(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mu_global\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sigma_global </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pm.HalfNormal(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sigma_global\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 非中心化：theta = mu + sigma * z</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pm.Normal(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">shape</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">J)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    theta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pm.Deterministic(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"theta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, mu_global </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sigma_global </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 比中心化参数化混合更好（特别是 sigma_global 小时）</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"numpyro-jax-加速的现代选择\">NumPyro：JAX 加速的现代选择</h2><p>NumPyro 基于 JAX 构建，利用 JIT 编译和 GPU 加速实现极快推断，适合大规模数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpyro&#10;import numpyro.distributions as dist&#10;from numpyro.infer import MCMC, NUTS, SVI, Trace_ELBO&#10;import jax&#10;import jax.numpy as jnp&#10;&#10;def bayesian_regression(X, y=None):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;NumPyro 贝叶斯线性回归模型&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    n, d = X.shape&#10;    alpha  = numpyro.sample(&quot;alpha&quot;, dist.Normal(0, 10))&#10;    beta   = numpyro.sample(&quot;beta&quot;,  dist.Normal(jnp.zeros(d), jnp.ones(d)))&#10;    sigma  = numpyro.sample(&quot;sigma&quot;, dist.HalfNormal(5))&#10;    mu     = alpha + X @ beta&#10;    numpyro.sample(&quot;y&quot;, dist.Normal(mu, sigma), obs=y)&#10;&#10;# NUTS 采样（自动 JIT 编译）&#10;import numpy as np&#10;X = np.random.randn(500, 5)&#10;y = X @ np.array([1, -1, 2, 0.5, -0.5]) + np.random.randn(500) * 0.5&#10;&#10;nuts_kernel = NUTS(bayesian_regression)&#10;mcmc = MCMC(nuts_kernel, num_warmup=500, num_samples=1000, num_chains=4)&#10;mcmc.run(jax.random.PRNGKey(0), X=X, y=y)&#10;mcmc.print_summary()&#10;&#10;# SVI（变分推断，更快）&#10;from numpyro.infer.autoguide import AutoNormal&#10;guide = AutoNormal(bayesian_regression)&#10;svi   = SVI(bayesian_regression, guide, numpyro.optim.Adam(0.01), Trace_ELBO())&#10;svi_result = svi.run(jax.random.PRNGKey(1), 3000, X=X, y=y)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpyro</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpyro.distributions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dist</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpyro.infer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MCMC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NUTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SVI</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Trace_ELBO</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jax</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jax.numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jnp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bayesian_regression</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(X, y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"NumPyro 贝叶斯线性回归模型\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    n, d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> X.shape</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    alpha  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpyro.sample(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"alpha\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, dist.Normal(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    beta   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpyro.sample(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"beta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  dist.Normal(jnp.zeros(d), jnp.ones(d)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sigma  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpyro.sample(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sigma\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, dist.HalfNormal(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mu     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> X </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> beta</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    numpyro.sample(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"y\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, dist.Normal(mu, sigma), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">obs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">y)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># NUTS 采样（自动 JIT 编译）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.random.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> X </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.array([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.random.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">nuts_kernel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NUTS(bayesian_regression)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mcmc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MCMC(nuts_kernel, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">num_warmup</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">num_samples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">num_chains</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mcmc.run(jax.random.PRNGKey(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">X</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">y)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mcmc.print_summary()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># SVI（变分推断，更快）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpyro.infer.autoguide </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoNormal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">guide </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoNormal(bayesian_regression)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">svi   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SVI(bayesian_regression, guide, numpyro.optim.Adam(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), Trace_ELBO())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">svi_result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> svi.run(jax.random.PRNGKey(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">X</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">y)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>NumPyro 的性能优势：JAX <code>jit</code> 将模型编译为 XLA 代码，首次运行慢（编译），后续极快。在 GPU 上对大型数据集可比 PyMC 快 10-100 倍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ppl-选择指南\">PPL 选择指南</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Q1[&quot;数据规模?&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;大(&gt;10^5)&quot;| Q2[&quot;需要 GPU?&quot;]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|&quot;小/中&quot;| Q3[&quot;语言偏好?&quot;]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| NumPyro[&quot;NumPyro / Pyro&quot;]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| PyMC[&quot;PyMC&quot;]&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|&quot;Python&quot;| Q4[&quot;精度还是速度?&quot;]&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|&quot;Julia&quot;| Turing[&quot;Turing.jl&quot;]&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|&quot;不限&quot;| Q5[&quot;复杂度?&quot;]&#10;    Q4 --&gt;|&quot;精度&quot;| Stan2[&quot;Stan(via CmdStanPy)&quot;]&#10;    Q4 --&gt;|&quot;速度+便利&quot;| PyMC2[&quot;PyMC&quot;]&#10;    Q5 --&gt;|&quot;高精度/复杂模型&quot;| Stan3[&quot;Stan&quot;]&#10;    Q5 --&gt;|&quot;快速原型&quot;| PyMC3[&quot;PyMC / NumPyro&quot;]\">graph TD\n    Q1[\"数据规模?\"] --&gt;|\"大(&gt;10^5)\"| Q2[\"需要 GPU?\"]\n    Q1 --&gt;|\"小/中\"| Q3[\"语言偏好?\"]\n    Q2 --&gt;|\"是\"| NumPyro[\"NumPyro / Pyro\"]\n    Q2 --&gt;|\"否\"| PyMC[\"PyMC\"]\n    Q3 --&gt;|\"Python\"| Q4[\"精度还是速度?\"]\n    Q3 --&gt;|\"Julia\"| Turing[\"Turing.jl\"]\n    Q3 --&gt;|\"不限\"| Q5[\"复杂度?\"]\n    Q4 --&gt;|\"精度\"| Stan2[\"Stan(via CmdStanPy)\"]\n    Q4 --&gt;|\"速度+便利\"| PyMC2[\"PyMC\"]\n    Q5 --&gt;|\"高精度/复杂模型\"| Stan3[\"Stan\"]\n    Q5 --&gt;|\"快速原型\"| PyMC3[\"PyMC / NumPyro\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐 PPL</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>学术研究，发表</td>\n<td>Stan</td>\n<td>最严格、文档充分、可重现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产环境，Python</td>\n<td>PyMC + NumPyro</td>\n<td>生态成熟，部署便捷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大规模数据 + GPU</td>\n<td>NumPyro</td>\n<td>JAX 性能无可替代</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度贝叶斯模型</td>\n<td>Pyro</td>\n<td>PyTorch 原生集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Julia 生态</td>\n<td>Turing.jl</td>\n<td>Julia 性能 + 表达力极强</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>PPL 将模型表达与推断引擎解耦，让统计学家/工程师专注于领域建模</li>\n<li>Stan 最成熟、最严格，是统计研究者的黄金标准；PyMC 对 Python 生态最友好</li>\n<li>NumPyro 利用 JAX 的 JIT 和 GPU 支持，在大规模场景性能领先</li>\n<li>自动微分是现代 PPL 的共同底座——用户写模型代码，AD 自动计算梯度供 HMC/VI 使用</li>\n<li>非中心化参数化是提升 MCMC 混合质量的核心技巧，各 PPL 都应掌握</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"概率编程语言生态","id":"概率编程语言生态"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Stan：统计学研究者的首选","id":"stan-统计学研究者的首选"},{"level":2,"text":"PyMC：Python 生态的首选","id":"pymc-python-生态的首选"},{"level":2,"text":"NumPyro：JAX 加速的现代选择","id":"numpyro-jax-加速的现代选择"},{"level":2,"text":"PPL 选择指南","id":"ppl-选择指南"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"变分推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-statistics/computation/variational-inference"},"next":{"title":"层次模型与部分池化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-statistics/modeling/hierarchical-models-partial-pooling"}}